{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"20":{"eng-name":"The Chapters on Legal Punishments","ara-name":"كتاب الحدود"}},"section_detail":{"20":{"hadithnumber_first":2533,"hadithnumber_last":2614,"arabicnumber_first":2533,"arabicnumber_last":2614}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2572,"arabicnumber":2572,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Hurairah : Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) a dit : “S’il s’enivre, fouettez-le. S’il recommence, fouettez-le. S’il recommence encore, fouettez-le.” Et à propos de la quatrième fois, il a dit : “S’il recommence, frappez-lui le cou (c’est-à-dire exécutez-le).”","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":20,"hadith":40},"chapter":{"id":17,"ara-name":"باب مَنْ شَرِبَ الْخَمْرَ مِرَارًا","eng-name":"One Who Drinks Wine Repeatedly","isFirstHadith":true}}]}